{"subtitle":"","author":"锵稿编辑部","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2025-01-05T18:00","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-9118","title":"2024中国电影十佳","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-001.jpg","imageText":"AS\n2024国电影十伴\nLAST\nDANCE\n*2024年之内在中国大陆电影市场正式公映之中国电影\n（含港澳台出品）"},{"text":"2024中国电影十佳 NO.10","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 2","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-002.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"《从21世纪安全撤离》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"完全找回了《李献计历险记》的状态，中二、神经质、毒舌、热血、LSD麻醉感，15年的时间好像从李阳身上不着痕迹地掠过，归属于情绪的电影，给80后的赞美诗。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一伊文西（豆瓣/知乎双料大V影评人）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"2024中国电影十佳 NO.9"},{"text":"《出走的决心》承续了易卜生《玩偶之家》的主题，哀而不伤。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"——周黎明（双语作家，好莱坞研究者）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"2024中国电影十佳 NO.7","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"（并列）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-004.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"《雄狮少年2》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"在理解动画和动作，或者说这种媒介属性方面，《雄狮少年》系列在中国动画当中断层领先。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"—灰狼（电影学博士，高校教师）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"2024中电影十任 NO.7\n（并列）"},{"text":"《破·地狱》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"欠缺死亡教育的社会，多一个认真谈论死亡的故事都是好的。《破·地狱》略露骨地讲出，超度亡者实则是抚慰生者。这当然是“谎言”，但绝非简单的戏剧性和解。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一杨 (小说家，影视策划)","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"2024中电影十 NO.6","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-006.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"《走走停停》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"片尾车河那一幕，堪称全年华语银幕最具电影感的瞬间之一。比起霸道宝总，这一部和之前的《不虚此行》，或许才是真正适合胡歌的新赛道。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一红鱼（编剧，《电影世界》前主笔）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"2024中国电影十佳 NO.5","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-007.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"《妈妈和七天的时间》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"母亲与女儿们之间的关系并未直接呈现，但她的情感气息却通过影像在三个孩子身上不断折射延伸。它让我们获得了某种独属于中国而其他文化无法复制的的视觉体验。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一开寅（笔名九苍，电影学博士）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"2024中国电影十佳 NO.4"},{"text":"《朱同在三年级丢失了超能力》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"长不长大都是一回事，总有一种力量，阻止孩子们生长。我们从来没有什么超能力，我们迟早都有各自的小学三年级。这不是以孩子的视角反观成人，而是两种年龄段，毫无胜利感的会师。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一赛人（电视节目策划，知名影评人）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"2024中国电影十佳 NO.3"},{"text":"《里斯本丸沉没》具体的生命，比宏大价值更珍贵。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一梅雪风（《看电影·午夜场》创刊主编）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"2024中国电影十佳 NO.2","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-010.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"《周处除三害》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"有种很正经的不正经味道，特别适合这个大家都想发癫的时代。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一徐元（媒体人，枪稿/稿主编）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2024中国电影十佳 · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9118/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"2024中电影十佳 NO.1"},{"text":"《好东西》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一篇童话、一场狂欢，或是一堂课、一份启蒙的决心。它就像是一个活生生站在观众面前的人，它是会呼吸的，有自己独特的偏好、矛盾、犹豫和不耐烦，但不管观众是否，认可它的好，都无法否认它独特的光芒。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一 一三喜（中英双语影评人，枪稿前主笔）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"根据参与者的个人年度十佳，按1～10名，记10～1分，算总和，得出最终排名。·参与者为15位稿核心作者，名单如下（按姓氏拼音）：大宝剑、曹米糯、红鱼、灰狼、开寅、梅雪风、三喜、赛人、徐元、杨时旸、杨受、伊文西、远方阿怪、周黎明、子戈。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}]}